{"id":"2ec0bac4674c9e87","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-resolventcover.md","title":"Generalized covering inequalities of a resolvent","display":"thm-resolventcover — Generalized covering inequalities of a resolvent","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-resolventcover","aliases":["27-thm-resolventcover"],"display":"thm-resolventcover — Generalized covering inequalities of a resolvent","depends_on":["[[27-df-resolvent]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§1.13.6 Theorems 1.39–1.40","source_printed_pages":"62,63","source_pdf_pages":"86,87","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-resolventcover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-resolventcover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-resolventcover — Generalized covering inequalities of a resolvent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4a21ca3b3930018\" href=\"?note=e4a21ca3b3930018\" title=\"27-df-resolvent\">27-df-resolvent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.13.6 Theorems 1.39–1.40"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"62,63"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"86,87"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(F\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_F\">\\(r_F\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e4a21ca3b3930018\" href=\"?note=e4a21ca3b3930018\" title=\"27-df-resolvent\">27-df-resolvent</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B:[m]\\to\\mathcal P([n])\">\\(A,B:[m]\\to\\mathcal P([n])\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A(k)\">\\(A_k=A(k)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_k=B(k)\">\\(B_k=B(k)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in[m]\\;(A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing)\">\\(\\forall k\\in[m]\\;(A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing)\\)</span>。假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(r_F(a)=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j)\\mid k\\in[m]\\}))\">\\(\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(r_F(a)=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j)\\mid k\\in[m]\\}))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb R^n\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F=\\left\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid\\forall k\\in[m]\\;\\sum_{i\\in A_k}a_i-\\sum_{j\\in B_k}a_j\\le|A_k|-1\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F=\\left\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid\\forall k\\in[m]\\;\\sum_{i\\in A_k}a_i-\\sum_{j\\in B_k}a_j\\le|A_k|-1\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\forall k\\in[m]\\;B_k=\\varnothing\\right)\\Rightarrow\\left(F=\\left\\{(1-y_i)_{i\\in[n]}\\mid y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\land\\forall k\\in[m]\\;\\sum_{i\\in A_k}y_i\\ge1\\right\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\forall k\\in[m]\\;B_k=\\varnothing\\right)\\Rightarrow\\left(F=\\left\\{(1-y_i)_{i\\in[n]}\\mid y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\land\\forall k\\in[m]\\;\\sum_{i\\in A_k}y_i\\ge1\\right\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i(1-y_i)=\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i-\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i y_i\\qquad(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i(1-y_i)=\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i-\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i y_i\\qquad(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个 DNF 项等于零，当且仅当至少一个正文字为零或至少一个负文字为零，正好给出相应覆盖不等式。若 DNF 全正，代换 y=1−a 后成为集合覆盖约束，最大化 c·a 等价于最小化 c·y。空项会产生 0≤−1 的矛盾，空 DNF 则不给约束，两种退化情形均正确。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-resolvent","status":"resolved","id":"e4a21ca3b3930018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-resolvent]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-resolvent","status":"resolved","id":"e4a21ca3b3930018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$m\\in\\mathbb N$，$F\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n$，$r_F$ 见 [[27-df-resolvent]]。$A,B:[m]\\to\\mathcal P([n])$，$A_k=A(k)$、$B_k=B(k)$，且 $\\forall k\\in[m]\\;(A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing)$。假定 $\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(r_F(a)=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j)\\mid k\\in[m]\\}))$。$c\\in\\mathbb R^n$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"r_F","display":false},{"tex":"A,B:[m]\\to\\mathcal P([n])","display":false},{"tex":"A_k=A(k)","display":false},{"tex":"B_k=B(k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in[m]\\;(A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(r_F(a)=\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j)\\mid k\\in[m]\\}))","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\left\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid\\forall k\\in[m]\\;\\sum_{i\\in A_k}a_i-\\sum_{j\\in B_k}a_j\\le|A_k|-1\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\forall k\\in[m]\\;B_k=\\varnothing\\right)\\Rightarrow\\left(F=\\left\\{(1-y_i)_{i\\in[n]}\\mid y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\land\\forall k\\in[m]\\;\\sum_{i\\in A_k}y_i\\ge1\\right\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i(1-y_i)=\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i-\\sum_{i=1}^n c_i y_i\\qquad(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).","display":true}],"bytes":1980,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-resolventcover|thm-resolventcover — Generalized covering inequalities of a resolvent]]"}],"outgoing":["e4a21ca3b3930018"]}